 | Trubuild Crackﬁll Paste
Ÿ | Further POP or painter’s putty application can be taken up once it is fully dry.
Ÿ | Fine hair line cracks must be widened with ‘V” groove up to 1 mm minimum and then ﬁll.
Ÿ | Care must be taken to avoid formation of cavities or bubbles during application.
Ÿ | Allow it to set for 24 hours and then apply another coat of Trubuild CFP-425.
LIMITATIONS
Ÿ | Should not be used for cracks more than 5 mm thickness.
Ÿ | Not for application in cracks of structural members, expansion joints & separation gaps.
Ÿ | For application below 10°C, drying time will be delayed.
